00:14:49,742 --> 00:14:53,924
You can provide custom mappings for rock types and rock terms in C types and terms.

201
00:14:54,318 --> 00:14:56,100
We have macro language that does that.

202
00:14:56,910 --> 00:15:00,516
this is a little messy right now, but I'm I'm gonna work on the macro language next.

