00:17:00,174 --> 00:17:01,220
Wait, let me start it again.

228
00:17:02,512 --> 00:17:02,832
Yeah.

229
00:17:03,310 --> 00:17:08,164
Rockman and our main character is Rock logo, and it's fighting against soundless bugs.

