266
00:20:19,918 --> 00:20:22,660
So here are the numbers for JSON, CSV, and some parsers.

267
00:20:23,408 --> 00:20:27,408
so at the moment, the OCaml extracted code is slightly faster than the Crane generated code.

268
00:20:27,568 --> 00:20:30,372
