00:22:20,494 --> 00:22:25,700
Uh these are functional programming program, functional programs written without performance in mind, the ones that I showed you.

287
00:22:26,222 --> 00:22:36,448
but we can get better performance out of these if we wrote our programs more linearly, if we avoided copying, if we avoided increasing verification, because that also can require more type erasure than we would like.

