00:22:46,958 --> 00:22:49,220
That is a fair point, but this is a lightweight form method.

292
00:22:49,614 --> 00:22:51,172
Our extractor is not verified.

293
00:22:51,808 --> 00:22:58,276
extraction, compile verification efforts are feasible, especially when you deal with a simple core language.

294
00:22:58,848 --> 00:23:01,892
and that is not the case for us because we had to generate readable code.

295
00:23:02,254 --> 00:23:07,140
And readability concerns force us to generate code in a larger surface language, which makes verification more difficult.

