314
00:24:30,574 --> 00:24:35,580
Uh raw co-inductives are also not perfect, but there are solutions like Paco, there's a co-induction plugin, et cetera.

315
00:24:36,432 --> 00:24:39,652
nested inductive types and particles are also less expressive in lean.

