00:35:33,774 --> 00:35:38,180
So I'm curious about this social aspect in your experience at Bloomberg.

444
00:35:38,542 --> 00:35:45,700
How does this work in terms of replacing existing code by auto-generated code that is not produced by the product teams of software engineers?

445
00:35:46,112 --> 00:35:46,352
Yeah.

