00:35:46,592 --> 00:35:56,740
So one this is one reason I really want to focus on readability because from their perspective, like this person might lead the company one day, this project might be discontinued one day.

447
00:35:56,974 --> 00:36:01,092
What happens to our products when with with all this auto-generated code when that happens?

448
00:36:02,222 --> 00:36:09,988
